24/25 pass on Linux (the remaining skip fetches a real published GitHub
release's checksum file and is intentionally not run offline).

No live/production self-update was performed against any real installed
NetRewind on this machine - the task explicitly calls for validating this via
its existing safe test mechanism rather than a real update, and one exists and
passes.
